Technique 4. Tune Gaussian Prior mean/ variance
The convergence of the IPF is affected by the mean and covariance matrix of the target Gaussian. In Appendix J.1 we investigate possible choices for these values. In practice we recommend to choose the variance of the Gaussian prior pprior to be slightly larger than the one of the target dataset and to choose the mean of pprior to be equal to the one of the target dataset. This remark is in accordance with (Song and Ermon, 2020, Technique 1).
